{"encoding":"verislop.autonomous-critique/0.1","verdict":"REPAIR","counterexamples":[],"corrections":[{"diagnostic_index":0,"artifact":"proposal.lean","explanation":"Replace the proof-search chains ending in sorry. Prove VeriSlopAST.floor_sum_correct with `by intro x h; rfl`. Prove VeriSlopAST.integer_arithmetic with `by exact VeriSlop.Native.contract_sound VeriSlopAST.IntegerArithmetic`, VeriSlopAST.python_entry with `by exact VeriSlop.Native.contract_sound VeriSlopAST.PythonEntry`, and VeriSlopAST.runtime_safety with `by exact VeriSlop.Native.contract_sound VeriSlopAST.RuntimeSafety`. Prove VeriSlopAST.valid_input_inhabited using `by refine ⟨VeriSlopAST.Input.mk 0 1 0 0, ?_⟩; decide`. These preserve the existing obligations and remove the unresolved proof-hole fallbacks."}]}